    "name": "VELOOP Rewards API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the VELOOP Rewards Wallet & Payout System. Backend is the source of truth for wallet balances, payout configuration and withdrawals. No real credentials or secrets are included. Final payout mapping: ₹10=1,000 VEs; ₹25=2,500 VEs; ₹50=5,000 VEs; ₹100=10,000 VEs; ₹150=15,000 VEs; ₹300=30,000 VEs; ₹500=50,000 VEs; ₹1,000=100,000 VEs.",
